            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We serve energy producers including California Resources Corporation, industrial agriculture leaders such as Grimmway Farms and Bolthouse Fresh Foods, major healthcare networks including Kern Medical and Adventist Health, educational institutions including Kern High School District and CSUB, plus municipal government and logistics operations throughout Kern County."
          }
