            "text": "Bakersfield organizations can recycle computers, laptops, cell phones, networking equipment, printers, copiers, servers, monitors, ink and toner, and other retired electronics. STS coordinates commercial collections for offices, agricultural operations, energy companies, healthcare systems, schools, public agencies, and logistics businesses throughout Kern County."
