            "text": "The process begins with equipment, quantity, access, and reporting details. STS then coordinates scheduled pickup, documents custody, transports equipment for appropriate downstream handling, and provides available project records. Bakersfield organizations can request equipment inventories, data-related service records, and final disposition documentation based on project requirements."
