          "name": "What standards are relevant to Bakersfield electronics recycling?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Relevant project references can include NIST SP 800-88 for media sanitization, DoD 5220.22-M references, HIPAA 45 CFR 164.312, and ISO 27001 controls. STS identifies the services and records available for each engagement. Organizations retain responsibility for their own regulatory decisions and requirements."
